<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Public Bank 1996 net up 23.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Public Bank 1996 net up 23.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Dec. 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		    408.02	  vs	330.44</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	    24.7	   vs	 20.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		     3,324.84	vs	2,435.50</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		 791.70	vs	  578.76</p>
<p>    Minorities less		148.11	vs   less  92.18</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries   loss	15.61	vs	   nil</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		 7.0	 vs	    8.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Public Bank Bhd is a banking and financial services concern.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201 4813)</p>
